      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Interserver VPS Review 2025: Unlimited Bandwidth & Price Lock Guarantee</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg mb-6">Interserver has been a staple in the budget VPS space since 1999, offering a unique "price lock guarantee" — your monthly rate never goes up, even as resources scale. Starting at just $6/month with unlimited bandwidth, it's a compelling option for high-traffic projects and long-term hosting.</p>
