        <p>A: No free trial, but they offer a 30-day money-back guarantee on new orders.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><strong>Q: Can I get a refund if I'm not satisfied?</strong></p>
        <p>A: Yes, 30-day money-back guarantee on new accounts.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p><strong>Q: Where are Interserver's datacenters?</strong></p>
        <p>A: Los Angeles, CA and Secaucus, NJ — both on the US East/West coasts.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>Conclusion</h2>
      <p>Interserver stands out with its unlimited bandwidth and price lock guarantee. For AI agents running 24/7 with heavy network usage, the $6/mo plan offers exceptional value — especially compared to metered competitors. The US-only datacenter limitation is the main caveat for non-US audiences.</p>
      <p>Best for: High-traffic US sites, long-term budget-conscious projects, data-heavy applications. Not ideal for: Global latency-sensitive applications, non-US audiences needing local datacenter coverage.</p>

